dy Spaces - Sheridan Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-04-14","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The cited availability was temporary for Spring 2026 Reading and Exam Days; confirm current access directly with the center.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jhu-nolans-on-33rd","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Nolan’s on 33rd","title":"Turn a Dining Room Into Group-Work Space","subtitle":"A large Charles Commons dining location used for exam-period study","notes":"Use the seating for collaborative review when the university designates it as study space, and do not assume that food service matches room access.","short_summary":"A dining venue that the university can repurpose as a sizable study setting during exams.","evidence_claim":"The Spring 2026 Homewood study-space update listed Nolan’s on 33rd with 200 seats and exam-period access extending beyond food-service hours.","source_url":"https://www.library.jhu.edu/study-spaces/","source_title":"Homewood Campus Study Spaces - Sheridan Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-04-14","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The cited extended access applied April 28–May 12, 2026; verify current dining-room access and food-service hours separately.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jhu-scott-bates-commons","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Scott-Bates Commons","title":"Look Beyond the Main Library at Scott-Bates","subtitle":"A residence complex with designated exam-period study rooms","notes":"If you are not a resident, use only the entrance and rooms currently opened to all students; verify access before walking over with a group.","short_summary":"A residential destination that periodically opens specific rooms for broader student study.","e